---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="max-w-[750px]">
    <div class="mb-5">
      <div
        style="font-family:'Space Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-weight:400;font-size:2rem;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#2E2825;"
      >
        Profile
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-10 leading-relaxed">
      I started in UX research, and somewhere along the way I got curious about
      how products are actually built — not just how they should be designed. So
      I learned development. Understanding the technical side changed how I
      think about design problems, and I've been working across both ever since.
      I'm genuinely interested in human needs and what it takes to build things
      that actually serve them. These days I'm also enthusiastic about vibe
      coding and AI-assisted workflows — finding ways to build faster and think
      more freely.
    </div>

    <div class="mb-5">
      <div
        style="font-family:'Space Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-weight:400;font-size:2rem;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#2E2825;"
      >
        Education
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
      <TimeLineElement
        title="University of Galway"
        subtitle="2022 – 2024 · MSc in Software Design And Development, 1st Class Honours · Galway, Ireland"
      />
      <TimeLineElement
        title="Nanjing Forestry University"
        subtitle="2018 – 2021 · MSc in Industrial Design Engineering, Top 10% · Nanjing, China"
      />
      <TimeLineElement
        title="Nanjing Forestry University"
        subtitle="2014 – 2018 · BSc in Industrial Design, Top 20% · Nanjing, China"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="mb-5">
      <div
        style="font-family:'Space Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-weight:400;font-size:2rem;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#2E2825;"
      >
        Experience
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
      <TimeLineElement
        title="Software Developer · OneTouch Health"
        subtitle="2025 – 2026 · Galway, Ireland"
      >
        <ul class="list-disc ml-4 space-y-1">
          <li>
            Worked in a Product Trio, collaborating across time zones to build
            and iterate a care management SaaS platform, serving hundreds of
            organizations in the UK, Ireland, and Australia.
          </li>
          <li>
            Enhanced core functionalities (nursing scheduling, eMAR, payroll
            settlement) using PHP, MySQL, JavaScript, and AJAX; streamlined
            operational workflows through asynchronous processing and resolved
            recurring UX issues reported by clients.
          </li>
          <li>
            Contributed to the development of a new Nursing Home module. Worked
            with product managers to refine business logic; mapped user flows
            and defined functional rules to implement features such as bed
            management and Progress Notes.
          </li>
          <li>
            Executed data migration from legacy servers to new environments,
            ensuring data integrity for millions of historical records.
          </li>
          <li>
            Performed regular code reviews, using AI-assisted tools to
            accelerate delivery. Managed environment consistency with Docker and
            version control with Git.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </TimeLineElement>
      <TimeLineElement
        title="Teaching Assistant · University of Galway"
        subtitle="2023 – 2024 · Galway, Ireland"
      >
        <ul class="list-disc ml-4 space-y-1">
          <li>
            Delivered tutorials and lab sessions for 70+ Master's students in
            Programming and Machine Learning; provided one-on-one support for
            concept clarification and coding challenges.
          </li>
          <li>
            Independently graded 70%+ of student assessments each semester,
            ensuring timely evaluations and alignment with faculty standards.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </TimeLineElement>
      <TimeLineElement
        title="UX Consultant · ISAR Interface Design Co."
        subtitle="2020 – 2022 · Nanjing, China"
      >
        <ul class="list-disc ml-4 space-y-1">
          <li>
            Supported the digital transformation for a large commercial bank.
            Through 43 in-depth interviews & large-scale quantitative
            validation, identified requirements across 9 business modules;
            delivered a 109-page report, 400+ prototypes, and interactive demos,
            with solutions launched in production.
          </li>
          <li>
            Led scenario-based consumer research for a leading IoT brand's smart
            home product line. Prioritized 20 high-value scenarios from 149
            candidates via expert review, Kano model, and user/sales input,
            informing product and GTM strategy.
          </li>
          <li>
            Conducted usability evaluation of an AI low-code platform for a
            global technology enterprise. Organized 42 issues by severity and
            NPS; proposed competitor-informed iteration recommendations.
          </li>
          <li>
            Led user experience testing for an in-vehicle infotainment system,
            covering 21 task scenarios with 12 drivers in a controlled lab
            setting. Produced a phased optimization roadmap.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </TimeLineElement>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-5">
      <div
        style="font-family:'Space Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;font-weight:400;font-size:2rem;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#2E2825;"
      >
        Skills
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-10 space-y-2">
      <p>
        <span class="font-semibold">Product & UX:</span> user interviews, usability
        testing, A/B testing, requirements analysis, UX wireframing & prototyping,
        UML diagrams, PRD writing
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="font-semibold">Programming:</span> Java (Spring Boot), JavaScript
        & TypeScript (React), HTML/CSS
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="font-semibold">Data Analysis:</span> Python (Pandas), SQL, SPSS,
        data visualization
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="font-semibold">Tools:</span> Figma, Axure, Notion, Xmind, Git,
        Docker, AWS, Microsoft Office, AI-assisted tools (Claude Code, Cursor)
      </p>
      <p>
        <span class="font-semibold">Languages:</span> English (fluent), Mandarin (native),
        Cantonese (fluent)
      </p>
    </div>
    <script is:inline>
      try {
        localStorage.setItem("site-lang", "en");
      } catch (e) {}
      document.querySelector('button[data-lang="zh"]')?.addEventListener(
        "click",
        function (e) {
          e.stopImmediatePropagation();
          window.location.href = "/cv-zh/";
        },
        true,
      );
    </script>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
